---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Brighton Digital Festival 2013 #BDF2013" description="Brighton Digital Festival 2013 #BDF2013 - readysaltedcode story">
  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/stories">Stories</a>
      </nav>
      <h1>Brighton Digital Festival 2013 #BDF2013</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <article class="story-content">
    <div class="container">
      <p>I am really looking forward to the events that I am running or partcipating in.  This weekend is jam packed with the TinyGames <a href="http://www.brightondigitalfestival.co.uk/events/game-jam-with-hide-seek/#.UjGP0GTXgU4">Game Jam</a> at the Lighthouse on saturday. This swiftly followed by join the <a href="http://www.brightondigitalfestival.co.uk/events/big-data-hackathon-data-storytelling-the-global-financial-crisis-and-recovery/#.UjGQGGTXgU4">Big Data Hack</a> at the Fusebox.</p>
      <p>The data hack is running for 48hours from Friday through to Sunday at 6pm.  I am unable to the whole weekend due to being part of the cool TIny Games event.  This is why the Brighton Digital Festival is so amazing.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 3rem 0;
  }
  .breadcrumb { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .breadcrumb a { color: #ccc; }
  .page-header h1 { color: #fff; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .story-content { padding: 3rem 0; }
  .story-content .container { max-width: 800px; }
  .story-content p { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.8; }
  .story-content img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 1.5rem 0; border-radius: 8px; }
  .story-content a { color: #dd3333; }
  .story-content blockquote { border-left: 4px solid #dd3333; padding-left: 1.5rem; margin: 1.5rem 0; font-style: italic; color: #555; }
  .story-content strong { font-weight: 600; }
</style>
